From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GDmio <zhalin66@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 09:53:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 18/31] BlueOS: SystemUI: Widgets 0.6.1

- Every widget keeps an 8 dp margin inside its cells (the card sat edge
  to edge, so widgets touched each other and the screen edge on any grid).
- Summary is centered in whatever size it is stretched to.
- One card material: music and the player equalizer no longer use an
  accent-colored card; the accent stays on the details.
- No widget updates before the user unlocks: AppWidgetManager threw at
  boot (wallpaper colors change while locked) and SystemUI crashed.

Change-Id: I41fccb694b7ce0cf8ed01d6e77dbc6bfe014f750
